    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>You\u2019re a weak fighter trying to prove yourself in a harsh world. But after a dangerous journey to the legendary Mountain of Power, you become the new God of Thunder..</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>You must clear your name after being framed for a crime you didn\u2019t commit. Along the way, you\u2019ll explore a dark fantasy world, battle enemies, and meet several girls in a new world filled with fun, mystery, and sex.</i><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3332070/extras/2fa8733ee4233b54caa3d7cd3ea643da.avif?t=1737354861\" width=616 height=347 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dark Fantasy Godhood is a choice-driven adult Visual Novel featuring:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 3000 static images and more than <u><strong>300</strong></u> animated scenes!!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2-3 Hours of solid gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your girls clothes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A deep and engaging medieval fantasy world</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plenty of lewd scenes with various girls</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Act 1 and 2</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>High quality visuals</strong> \ud83c\udf1f - Amazing scenes with high-quality rendering.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3332070/extras/fce340c183772f0120a57ee691771e0c.avif?t=1737354861\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DOZENS of characters \u00a0</strong>- So many characters for you to romance and enjoy</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3332070/extras/b449c2524f6352fa889802c6ccc27054.avif?t=1737354861\" data-has-big width=800 height=188 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Great animation \ud83c\udf9e - Lush, smooth and juicy animations showcasing the action from many angles.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3332070/extras/541ae17491aee43cf5b10fa5be3cb217.poster.avif?t=1737354861\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3332070/extras/541ae17491aee43cf5b10fa5be3cb217.webm?t=1737354861\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3332070/extras/541ae17491aee43cf5b10fa5be3cb217.mp4?t=1737354861\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lore \ud83d\udcd9 - A rich, captivating world filled with deep lore waiting to be explored</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3332070/extras/fda63bebf4db52639625b49bfd7b60d8.avif?t=1737354861\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>",
